Patches origin
--------------

For out-of-tree device support, patches were imported from the following
community-maintained kernel forks:
  * sdm670: https://gitlab.com/sdm670-mainline/linux-patches

Those patchsets were last synced on the following dates:
  * sdm670: 2025-01-31

Following patch was backported from the sdm670-mainline/linux-patches
repository when it was based on top of 6.15:

  * debian/patches/sdm670/0122-power-supply-qcom_fg-invert-charging-current.patch

Following patches were backported from the sdm670-mainline/linux-patches
repository when it was based on top of 6.19:

  * debian/patches/sdm670/0123-dt-bindings-qcom-lpass-lpi-common-add-reserved-GPIOs-property.patch
  * debian/patches/sdm670/0124-arm64-dts-qcom-sdm670-google-add-reserved-lpi-gpios.patch
